    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-10-31T09:20:16+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-31T09:20:16+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-30T22:50:16Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-30T22:50:16Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A low pressure system south of the Bight extends a trough over far southeast of state and will continue to move east clearing the state this morning, followed by a new high pressure system. Another low pressure system is expected to enter from the west on Sunday, moving over central and eastern districts on Monday, followed by another ridge of high pressure which will persist until Tuesday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW006" description="Riverland" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-10-31T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-01T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-30T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-31T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Cloud clearing. Winds westerly 25 to 35 km/h turning southwesterly 20 to 30 km/h in the middle of the day then decreasing to 15 to 20 km/h in the evening. Daytime maximum temperatures in the high 20s.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">High</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:00am to 4:40pm, UV Index predicted to reach 10 [Very High]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-11-01T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-02T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-31T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-01T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. The chance of fog in the early morning. Very high chance of showers. The chance of a thunderstorm in the evening. Light winds becoming north to northwesterly 15 to 20 km/h in the middle of the day then shifting easterly in the early afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to around 10 with daytime temperatures reaching the mid to high 20s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-11-02T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-03T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-01T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-02T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Medium chance of showers, most likely in the morning. The chance of a thunderstorm in the morning. Mostly sunny afternoon. Winds east to northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h shifting southwesterly 25 to 40 km/h during the day. Overnight temperatures falling to around 15 with daytime temperatures reaching around 30.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-11-03T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-04T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-02T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-03T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. Winds southwesterly 15 to 25 km/h becoming light during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 11 with daytime temperatures reaching the high 20s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
